1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,990
She wants to make a snowman.

2
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:07,390
First, she rolls a large ball of snow.

3
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,010
Second, she rolls a medium ball of snow.

4
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:17,050
Finally, she rolls a small ball of snow

5
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,750
for the snowman's head.

6
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:21,050
She stacks them up.

7
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:24,490
The largest ball is on the bottom.

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,550
She puts a carrot for the nose.

9
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:32,310
She uses buttons for the eyes and mouth.

10
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,290
The last thing she adds is a scarf.
